WEBVTT

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:09.950
Don't try to cover me up and do unnecessary things

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.820
Damn it, I'm sick of having to borrow money from someone

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.420
If you can get out, you won't have to borrow money

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.080
Amen.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.480
Renji's blood is still running.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.730
If that's the case, then that Chainsaw is...

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:35.950
Let's get out of here.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.780
I want to be the hero, I want to live in a paradise

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:48.040
This voice I saw in the depths of hell

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:51.080
The good parts of the darkness

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.860
I know but I'm not that bad

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.230
I can't breathe on this..

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.110
I'm full of blood..

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.310
I'm gonna kill you..

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:38.150
Just die..

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:50.190
There are no more words to describe this

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:51.750
I'm just drinking

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.240
While watching your suffering

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.220
It's like a strawberry jam

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.070
Thank you for watching!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.260
Devil-fearing Devil Hunters...

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.440
It's a guy whose head screws are blown away.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.100
Saharau

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:16.970
That's right.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.660
That's why I died.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.250
Kinouchi is fine, and so is Subaru.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.760
Sasegi-mama and her friends.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.610
I'm scared of the devil's attack because I'm serious.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.700
Fear is the power of the devil.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.990
Why don't you work with me and see how Aki is doing?

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:39.740
Well, I guess so.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.250
The person who is trying to kill the gunman...

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.120
It can't be right, can it?

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:49.080
You entered the court because you wanted to kill the gunman, didn't you?

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.220
The screw on your head is blown away.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:54.550
It's not flying.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:56.350
That's right.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.320
You also want to kill a gunman, don't you?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.900
That's what most Devil Hunters think.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.440
They're honest and straightforward.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:07.890
That's why I don't know what to do with the devils.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.430
But I don't know what the guy with the screws is thinking.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.200
I'm afraid of what the devil can't understand.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:23.900
Master, you like to drink, don't you?

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.180
Yes, that's right.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.730
The pile of sins of the day loosens the screws.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.880
It's not like you're coming to your buddy's grave every month.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:41.240
I'm going home.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.320
Aki is still a kid, so train him.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.930
I'll do it slowly.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.640
You can't do it slowly.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:52.260
Aki is seriously collecting meat.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:56.430
He'll get to the gunman sooner or later.

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:15.920
Oh no no no no

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:24.390
Aki-kun, why don't we move to a private college together?

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.880
He's with really good students.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.180
I give up with a guy who's 내일

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:35.340
Even if you don't drink, you can eat here or somewhere for lunch, and go to the movies on your way home.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.460
That kind of everyday is fine.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.100
If I drink, I'll go with you no matter how much.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.590
But I will never go to a private place.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.110
I'll get some An-Nin tofu.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.740
Then, give me a cigarette.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:59.660
I'll fight the demon of the gun.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.560
I'm sure Yaki-kun will be killed.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.480
Even if we're still lacking in our abilities,

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:09.290
it's not because he's a devil who can kill hundreds of people in an instant.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:18.680
He's just a normal person like everyone else.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:44.630
I'm sorry.

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:49.660
You were killed by me and you shed your blood.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.780
I'll heal you with your blood.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:56.050
It's been a long time since I've done it.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.700
I'm sorry.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:11.190
If there's a guy with screws flying around here, I might be able to kill him.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:41.000
Aki-kun, are you still alive?

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:47.990
Yes, I am.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.650
It's been about three days since then.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:56.620
Let's go drink together.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.440
That's why I'm going to sleep for a while.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:09.200
It's my dream.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:15.790
Already?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.230
It was more comfortable than the pool.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:33.880
I was able to get out.

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:38.790
I was able to get the meat of the gun devil.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:40.970
It's sunny.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.040
It feels like it happened after that.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:45.410
It looks like it's floating.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:52.410
Hey, wait a minute...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.470
I kept killing devils without sleeping all the time.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.770
Aki-kun and Denji-kun are...

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.430
We'll take her to the hospital.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:04.460
The other two will go report on what happened this time.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:14.220
A welcome party for newbies?

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.350
That's right.

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.480
All four families have never met before.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:22.040
Let's deepen our silence and get rid of the problem we have now.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:23.280
Problem?

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:25.560
That is...

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.860
Kobeni-chan and Arai-kun are saying they're going to stop the court.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:33.880
Not only did the devil get scared, but Denji-kun also tried to kill him.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.420
Hime-no-senpai also tried to kill him, didn't he?

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.430
Yeah, that's how much he's going to quit.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.810
For now, let's just go with the flow.

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:52.280
If it's a drinking party, Denji-kun will apologize to you, and you'll be able to stop Kobeni-chan and the others, right?

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.210
You just want to drink, don't you?

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:56.140
Hmm...

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.940
It's small, but it has a meaty taste.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:00.480
If you're going to drink it...

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:01.660
It's definitely this week.

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:02.680
Hmm?

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:03.520
Why?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.190
If you're going to drink anyway...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:06.240
I want to drink with Makima-san.

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:16.350
Makima will be going to Kyoto next week.

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:19.010
In the case where Denji was targeted by the devil...

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:19.920
He's going to ask for your support.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:22.880
So if you're going to drink, you should drink this week.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:27.450
To be honest...

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.110
Who do you think Denji-kun is?

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:33.810
It seems that the devil of the other party knew about Denji.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.000
I've never seen him like that before.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.640
The biggest mystery is...

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.960
The fact that Makima-san is interested in Denji-kun...

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:45.570
Makima-san.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.000
I've been to many places, but I've only been to Tokyo recently.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.160
It's because Denji-kun is here, right?

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:52.430
Is it because you know Denji-kun's secret?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.750
I'll call Makima-san and ask her.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.440
I mean...

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:08.750
Shimi!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:23.460
It's been 6 months since I last drank.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.610
I drink a bit at home, too.

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:27.650
Get out of my way!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:29.610
Shimi is all mine!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.020
What's this? It looks delicious!

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:37.040
Um, I got lost on the road...

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.340
Kobe-chan, Kobe-chan, come here.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.780
Makima-san is coming late.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:48.140
Three parfaits. And three Shiratama ozen.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.430
This is the first time I've had such a delicious meal.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:55.200
Kobe-chan, you have a lot of money in your house.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:57.020
Eat a lot.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.020
Take it!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:58.820
What the hell are you doing, you son of a bitch!

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:00.650
It's mine!

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:02.790
Didn't you bring the witch from Fushi-san's place?

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.820
I can't bring her here because I'm scared.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.780
The witch from Hayakawa-san's place has a good sense of propriety.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:14.080
Come on, you're young, so please eat more.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.290
Ah, damn it. I don't feel like I can read.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:23.690
Um...

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:27.340
Oh...

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.390
Shirafu is embarrassing.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.320
I'll give you more if you get drunk.

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:32.840
What?

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.080
I'll make you a cute guy.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.360
Please forgive me for trying to kill Denji-kun with everyone.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.160
Ah, I'll forgive you so much!

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:48.650
It's a newcomer's welcome party, so introduce yourself as a newcomer.

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.320
Say the devil who has a contract with your name and age.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.640
Don't say the devil who has a contract at a public place.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.460
You can only show it to a trusted person.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:13:59.100
Yes.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.180
He sure is a tough guy.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.520
Well, it's fine. It's fine, right?

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:06.530
I want to ask you about your hobbies.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:09.220
You're a human being, aren't you?

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:12.850
I'm Denji. I'm 16 years old.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.920
My hobbies are eating and sleeping.

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:20.840
You don't drink, do you?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.280
I drink tea.

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:26.000
I'm Hirokazu Arai. I'm 22 years old.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:28.860
The devil I'm dating is a fox. My hobbies are haiku.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.310
The devil who signed with Hayapai is the same.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:37.380
The fox devil is an effective enemy to humans, so he has a contract with a lot of Devil Hunters.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.820
Only handsome guys can use the fox's head.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.130
That devil, because he eats noodles.

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:48.110
I'm Kobeni Higashiyama. I'm 20 years old.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:53.370
The devil who has a contract is a secret, and his hobby is to eat delicious food.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.720
Your clothes are cute, aren't they?

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:59.460
Ah, this is my sister's snack.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.890
What about the newcomer at Toshi-san's place?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.420
Unfortunately, he passed away yesterday.

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:10.350
Nanwabutsu!

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:12.970
Hōrengekyō?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.170
Senpai, you're...

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.940
You're going to die that easily?

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:22.280
I'll leave it to the court to deal with a devil that was impossible to deal with in private.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.620
Well, you're going to die a lot.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.880
My comrade is no longer in the court.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:29.960
Renji-kun.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.140
You want to kiss me, so you're not going to die, are you?

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:36.900
If you get drunk, you'll become a kisser.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:37.880
What?

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:42.200
Everyone here is kissed by Himeno, except for the newcomers.

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:43.790
You can't run away.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.510
It's a low kiss.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:54.870
I'm going to kiss you for the first time today.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:55.390
Kiss?

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:57.100
What?

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.520
Akima-san!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.620
Excuse me, can I have one raw please?

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.910
Makima-san, this way please.

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:09.450
I've never seen a real Makima-san before.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:14.540
Denji-kun, are you going to kiss someone?

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:15.620
I won't!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.820
Eh? Denji-kun, you're not going to kiss?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:19.620
I will!

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:25.650
Excuse me, one more raw please.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:29.190
And then kiss.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:33.430
I don't want Makima-san to see me kissing Himeno-san.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.920
Aren't you going to be a chief?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.700
But I still want to kiss him with the same level of strength.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:42.410
I have no choice but to keep this a secret for now.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.250
Makima-san, I picked up some of the gun demons.

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:50.880
Yeah, I heard. Denji-kun is amazing.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:55.880
Up until now, there have never been any demons with flesh and blood at such a fast pace.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.800
The demon that was after Denji the other day...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.860
I'm a little suspicious of the devil's movements recently.

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:03.750
Don't you know something about Makima-san and Denji?

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:18.480
If you drink more than me, I'll tell you.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:22.860
Excuse me, two raw.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:26.370
I'll do that, too.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:27.410
One more.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.870
I'm sorry, I have one more question.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.650
But you're amazing, Pawa-chan.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.000
There are very few magicians who are suppressed by a murderous impulse.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.700
I have a high IQ.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:51.760
Is it decided by IQ?

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.800
How much IQ do you have?

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:55.500
100

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:57.800
Is 100 high?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.980
I also have a high IQ.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.380
It was about 100.

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:02.580
Then it's 120.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.840
Fushi-san is expensive, isn't he?

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.940
It was 134.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:08.450
I'm proud of my memory.

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:12.840
I think it was 500.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:14.160
1000?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:28.090
He saw me.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:29.340
But what is it?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.860
This feeling is...

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.360
It feels good.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.200
It's soft.

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:34.760
What is this?

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.460
Blood?

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.460
It's melting in my blood.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.890
It's not blood.

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.180
It's Kero!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.470
I'm gonna kill you.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:47.500
Oh, my.

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.060
Excuse me.

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.060
Can I get you something to drink?

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:51.370
This is bad!

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:52.890
This is bad!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.380
I can't breathe!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.100
I'm gonna puke!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:07.360
Oh, Chita, I think I can eat this.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:21.290
Chita, the rats are gathering around the drunk Gero.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:24.680
I can't believe they're eating Gero.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:27.010
It's pathetic to be the same animal as them.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:35.230
Damn, Hime's senpai's self-esteem is not enough.

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:42.320
You're the one who let her go, right?

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.790
You were always freeing your mother when she went home from work.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:50.270
You didn't have the ability of a Devil Hunter, did you?

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:52.500
Shio.

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.300
You're serious?

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:59.310
Shio, don't give me a must-kiss.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.290
I'm serious. I'm jealous of that.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:13.190
I'll take care of the Hayakawa family.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.380
Arai, please take care of Himeno-chan.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.580
Everyone, it's Makima-san's treat, so let's be grateful.

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:25.150
Drinking alcohol with that money is the best, isn't it?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:25.780
Huh?

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.240
Where's Denji-kun?

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:34.460
If it's Denji-kun, Himeno-senpai carried him and took him away.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:41.300
It's dark. It's dark.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.230
Where is it?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:43.470
Here.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.120
Water.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:46.510
Water.

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:49.900
Speaking of which,

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:51.960
I was kissed by a black woman.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:56.120
Water.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:57.630
Water.

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:21.880
N-Nanji-kun? Why are you at my house?

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:27.060
Ah, I brought you here, right?

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:31.540
I'm getting dizzy.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.280
What is this?

